(b) the Requisite Company Vote shall have been obtained; and
(c) any applicable waiting period under the HSR Act relating to the transactions contemplated hereby shall have expired or been terminated.', 'location': 'PREM14A, Annex A, Section 9.01, Conditions to the Obligations of Each Party'}, {'quote': 'the required approval of the holders of at least a majority of the outstanding Shares entitled to vote in connection with the adoption of this Agreement, in accordance with Applicable Law and the Company’s certificate of incorporation (the “Requisite Company Vote”)', 'location': 'PREM14A, Annex A, Section 4.02(a), Corporate Authorization'}, {'quote': 'The obligations of Parent and Merger Sub to consummate the Merger are subject to the satisfaction (or the waiver by Parent) of the following conditions:
